        "Description": "We have located the cell&apos;s head scientists: the hospital director Akira Nakamura and the Tenri Shinosaki who is known as the Curator. We have discovered that they are in the final stages of secretly developing a neural device to clone humans, meaning they could clone terrorists and send them in for suicide missions. This must be stopped, or everything we have done before this will be for nothing. \rGood luck 47.",
